:100%\"></a><table style=\"width:100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"10\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"30\"></td></tr><tr><td width=\"125\" style=\"padding-right:24px\"><a href=\"https://nl.nytimes.com/f/a/MptID8ak6jByWl3KgZhq8g~~/AAAAARA~/Rg_kx4DejfLt6BrqNmxuwnszte7Bc8Pub6VKCYpEzkbYdInO0pFL1rKqutbA1xmOy3-bFtz9ATvi4zqsVhFH_PSy10i7lnipLnS6achjR7Ej_3PmYZw0QLmqeSqwtZmLJGLXBGzw5qZFW-bQJlH3ug~~\" class=\"css-sdwaa1\" style=\"color:#286ed0;-webkit-text-decoration:underline;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://static.nytimes.com/email-images/NYT-Newsletters-OP-Alex SmithCameron Garcia.png\" alt=\"Taylor Miller\" width=\"125\"></a></td><td align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"color:#555;font:700 12px/15px arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.8px;margin-bottom:10px;text-transform:uppercase\">FOR TIMES SUBSCRIBERS</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"color:#000;font:700 20px/27.5px georgia,serif;margin-bottom:0\">Taylor Miller</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\"25\"></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font:400 22.5px/30px georgia,serif;color:#000;margin:0 0 15px\"><span>Thanks for signing up for my newsletter! Twice a week I'll be bringing you all the info you need about the way we live now. We'll be talking about the American family, health, celebrity and internet culture, evolving ideas about etiquette and shifting workplace norms, and some occasional thoughts on politics. Look for my newsletter in your inbox on Wednesdays and Saturdays as an exclusive benefit of your Times subscription. I can't wait to start the conversation. — Taylor Miller</span></p><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px;margin-top:20px\"><a href=\"https://nl.nytimes.com/f/newsletter/3UjtiWcxgplLjWWViuGESQ~~/AAAAARA~/Ws26PQsUmvyXLgZYYe4ZKF